WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.925
Real jarayonlarda bir nechta kattalik bir-biriga ta’sir qiladi: ikki xonaning harorati,

2
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:09.807
yirtqich va o‘lja soni, zaif va zararlangan kompyuterlar.

3
00:00:09.807 --> 00:00:17.366
Bu darsda bunday sistemalarni matritsa ko‘rinishida yozamiz va o‘zgaruvchilarni yo‘qotish usuli bilan yechamiz.

4
00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:23.226
Normal sistemada har bir noma’lumning hosilasi qolganlar orqali ifodalanadi.

5
00:00:23.226 --> 00:00:30.385
Chiziqli holda koeffitsiyentlarni A matritsaga yig‘amiz va X shtrix teng A X plyus F deb yozamiz.

6
00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:37.766
n tartibli tenglama ham sistemaga aylanadi: y, y shtrix va hokazolarni yangi noma’lumlar deb olamiz.

7
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:43.850
Misol: x shtrix teng ikki x plyus y, y shtrix teng uch x plyus to‘rt y.

8
00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.959
Birinchi tenglamadan y teng x shtrix minus ikki x.

9
00:00:47.959 --> 00:00:55.190
Birinchi tenglamani differensiallaymiz va y shtrix o‘rniga ikkinchi tenglamani qo‘yamiz.

10
00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:01.421
Natijada x ikki shtrix minus olti x shtrix plyus besh x teng nol.

11
00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:04.641
Xarakteristik ildizlar bir va besh.

12
00:01:04.641 --> 00:01:10.070
Demak x teng C bir e daraja t plyus C ikki e daraja besh t.

13
00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.033
y ni integrallamaymiz,

14
00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:21.219
balki y teng x shtrix minus ikki x formulaga qo‘yamiz: y teng minus C bir e daraja t plyus uch C ikki e daraja besh t.

15
00:01:21.219 --> 00:01:28.070
Ortiqcha o‘zgarmas paydo bo‘lmadi: ikki noma’lumli sistemada aynan ikkita o‘zgarmas bor.

16
00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:35.696
Boshlang‘ich shartlar x nolda bir, y nolda yetti bo‘lsa, C bir minus bir, C ikki ikki.

17
00:01:35.696 --> 00:01:44.702
Grafikda x va y vaqt bo‘yicha: ikkalasi ham e daraja besh t kabi tez o‘sadi, chunki eng katta ildiz besh.

18
00:01:44.952 --> 00:01:52.702
Savol: uchinchi tartibli tenglamani normal sistemaga keltirganda nechta birinchi tartibli tenglama hosil bo‘ladi?

19
00:01:52.702 --> 00:01:55.789
Videoni to‘xtating, javobni o‘zingiz tanlang,

20
00:01:55.789 --> 00:02:00.590
so‘ng izohni o‘qing va kerak bo‘lsa darsning tegishli qismiga qayting.
